Acceptance criteria:
The smaller axolotl has a cream body, pink features and a gentle smile.
Mesh clicks toggle only its power without opening console tools. Its two
brightness levels visibly differ; off extinguishes both emissions and the
point emitter. Brightness selection while off leaves power off. GBA/DS
transitions preserve independent states. Existing consoles, props and pear-boy
do not initially overlap it; console and pear-boy movement respect its fixed
position. No new movement API, reference-image overlay or external asset.
Technical local completion does not imply owner approval or publication.

